    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Challenge the Wyld Land!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you risk to rise to greatness in this corrupted world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyld Land is a fast-paced, 2D bullet-hell roguelite MMORPG where you explore a dangerous world corrupted by ancient technology. Dodge waves of bullets, collect powerful gear, explore ever-changing dungeons, go raiding, and uncover the mysteries of a fallen civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/f07305575f8c21372bea51b6da80db69.avif?t=1754923197\" width=609 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/f16a13d7a38a97a9c42b4c96875e2844.poster.avif?t=1754923197\" width=608 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/f16a13d7a38a97a9c42b4c96875e2844.webm?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/f16a13d7a38a97a9c42b4c96875e2844.mp4?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat foes, earn loot.  Customize your build through equipment choices and Spikes, which are enhancements that weapons can come with. Mix and match weapons, armor, and spikes to create your perfect loadout. Earn higher tier equipment to challenge more difficult enemies and discover even greater strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/4926fd78c701bc3e707eed8faa48b96c.avif?t=1754923197\" width=609 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/dfef4e4205f3563fde1f8775b3800ab5.poster.avif?t=1754923197\" width=608 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/dfef4e4205f3563fde1f8775b3800ab5.webm?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/dfef4e4205f3563fde1f8775b3800ab5.mp4?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with others in an MMORPG world, combining might, gear, and experience to defeat the corrupted remnants. The world is shared, and danger lurks around every corner. Embark with friends or team-up with others you meet in-game. You can progress through most content solo, but it's always better to adventure with someone watching your back! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/81968ae4a67d4a2e0648c47c763474e8.avif?t=1754923197\" width=609 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/b9ab354c91fd9e5e7185e5001526217b.poster.avif?t=1754923197\" width=608 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/b9ab354c91fd9e5e7185e5001526217b.webm?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/b9ab354c91fd9e5e7185e5001526217b.mp4?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find dungeon portals by defeating enemies in the overworld. Delve inside and conquer powerful bosses to gain stronger loot. Bosses drop cosmetics and pets, but they also drop Exotic Weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exotic Weapons are powerful and come with unique effects that can change the way you play. Every boss has it's own Exotic Weapon, so try and collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/04f4ffe29d37c249e3b1660c53d9cc32.avif?t=1754923197\" width=609 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/6936e9f334bdc43d0bcdf7ed6ce4cf05.poster.avif?t=1754923197\" width=608 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/6936e9f334bdc43d0bcdf7ed6ce4cf05.webm?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/6936e9f334bdc43d0bcdf7ed6ce4cf05.mp4?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're strong enough, Corrupted Dungeons take the challenge even further with modifiers that change the experience and even tougher versions of bosses you previously faced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also take on group challenges in our Raids! Combine MMORPG mechanics with bullet hell chaos and the result is a task fit only for the toughest Runners out there. You will need to work together with your party and communicate efficiently to overcome even a single Raid Boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes: </strong>Death means losing all your gear - but some abilities, known as Echoes, persist through death. Build your power gradually while risking it all on each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Evolution: </strong>Regular updates bring new content, challenges, and mysteries to uncover. We plan to release Seasons on a regular basis which will shake up the meta of the game, introduce new weapons and gear, and provide new challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gone Fishing: </strong>Tired of being shot at? Craft some a lure, find some water, and toss it in! Soon enough you'll be meet with a flurry of flying fish that can be shot down. Trade your fresh catches in for cosmetics and crafting rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Dungeons: </strong>Dungeons in Wyld Land are procedurally generated, so you'll never see the same one twice. For the truly brave, pop corrupted shards and take on difficult mutations as the difficulty scales up even further -- but the rewards get better, too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization: </strong>Customize your build through equipment choices and Spikes - enhancements found throughout the game world. Mix and match weapons, armor, and spikes to create your perfect loadout.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Challenge the Wyld Land!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will you risk to rise to greatness in this corrupted world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyld Land is a fast-paced, 2D bullet-hell roguelite MMORPG where you explore a dangerous world corrupted by ancient technology. Dodge waves of bullets, collect powerful gear, explore ever-changing dungeons, go raiding, and uncover the mysteries of a fallen civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/f07305575f8c21372bea51b6da80db69.avif?t=1754923197\" width=609 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/f16a13d7a38a97a9c42b4c96875e2844.poster.avif?t=1754923197\" width=608 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/f16a13d7a38a97a9c42b4c96875e2844.webm?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/f16a13d7a38a97a9c42b4c96875e2844.mp4?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat foes, earn loot.  Customize your build through equipment choices and Spikes, which are enhancements that weapons can come with. Mix and match weapons, armor, and spikes to create your perfect loadout. Earn higher tier equipment to challenge more difficult enemies and discover even greater strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s