ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/b9ab354c91fd9e5e7185e5001526217b.mp4?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find dungeon portals by defeating enemies in the overworld. Delve inside and conquer powerful bosses to gain stronger loot. Bosses drop cosmetics and pets, but they also drop Exotic Weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exotic Weapons are powerful and come with unique effects that can change the way you play. Every boss has it's own Exotic Weapon, so try and collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/04f4ffe29d37c249e3b1660c53d9cc32.avif?t=1754923197\" width=609 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/6936e9f334bdc43d0bcdf7ed6ce4cf05.poster.avif?t=1754923197\" width=608 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/6936e9f334bdc43d0bcdf7ed6ce4cf05.webm?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387720/extras/6936e9f334bdc43d0bcdf7ed6ce4cf05.mp4?t=1754923197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're strong enough, Corrupted Dungeons take the challenge even further with modifiers that change the experience and even tougher versions of bosses you previously faced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also take on group challenges in our Raids! Combine MMORPG mechanics with bullet hell chaos and the result is a task fit only for the toughest Runners out there. You will need to work together with your party and communicate efficiently to overcome even a single Raid Boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes: </strong>Death means losing all your gear - but some abilities, known as Echoes, persist through death. Build your power gradually while risking it all on each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Evolution: </strong>Regular updates bring new content, challenges, and mysteries to uncover. We plan to release Seasons on a regular basis which will shake up the meta of the game, introduce new weapons and gear, and provide new challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gone Fishing: </strong>Tired of being shot at? Craft some a lure, find some water, and toss it in! Soon enough you'll be meet with a flurry of flying fish that can be shot down. Trade your fresh catches in for cosmetics and crafting rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Dungeons: </strong>Dungeons in Wyld Land are procedurally generated, so you'll never see the same one twice. For the truly brave, pop corrupted shards and take on difficult mutations as the difficulty scales up even further -- but the rewards get better, too.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization: </strong>Customize your build through equipment choices and Spikes - enhancements found throughout the game world. Mix and match weapons, armor, and spikes to create your perfect loadout.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Challenge the Wyld Land! Experience a free-to-play, roguelite, bullet-hell MMO where you band together with others to battle corrupted technological creatures and explore a dangerous world. Dodge waves of bullets, collect powerful gear, explore ever-changing dungeons, and become a legend!",
